 },
 {
  "en": "You do.",
  "start": 2152.76,
  "end": 2154.26
 },
 {
  "en": "And you're not a diabetic, are you?",
  "start": 2155.71,
  "end": 2158.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Right.",
  "start": 2162.24,
  "end": 2163.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael, tell me something.",
  "start": 2172.03,
  "end": 2174.12
 },
 {
  "en": "You think there's a part of you that enjoys this?",
  "start": 2176.09,
  "end": 2178.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Peroxide in an open wound? No.",
  "start": 2178.46,
  "end": 2181.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I mean escaping from prison...",
  "start": 2182.17,
  "end": 2185.2
 },
 {
  "en": "... and being on the run and the danger and the fear and the rush. all that.",
  "start": 2185.24,
  "end": 2189.4
 },
 {
  "en": "It....",
  "start": 2189.4,
  "end": 2191.0
 },
 {
  "en": "It feels to me like chasing a high.",
  "start": 2192.22,
  "end": 2195.49
 },
 {
  "en": "And I know what that's like...",
  "start": 2199.1,
  "end": 2202.07
 },
 {
  "en": "... and I should know better by now.",
  "start": 2202.11,
  "end": 2204.51
 },
 {
  "en": "I never thought about it like that.",
  "start": 2207.55,
  "end": 2209.57
 },
 {
  "en": "I know you've heard this before...",
  "start": 2216.25,
  "end": 2218.88
 },
 {
  "en": "... but it won't always be like this.",
  "start": 2218.94,
  "end": 2221.34
 },
 {
  "en": "From everything you've told me, it's getting worse.",
  "start": 2221.92,
  "end": 2224.32
 },
 {
  "en": "They can't chase us forever.",
  "start": 2224.38,
  "end": 2226.01
 },
 {
  "en": "The guy who caught up with us today stops at the border.",
  "start": 2226.11,
  "end": 2228.58
 },
 {
  "en": "That's why we have to get across.",
  "start": 2228.64,
  "end": 2230.73
 },
 {
  "en": "I have the people in place to help us do that.",
  "start": 2230.81,
  "end": 2232.94
 },
 {
  "en": "We're meeting them tomorrow.",
  "start": 2233.02,
  "end": 2234.95
 },
 {
  "en": "One more day, Sara.",
  "start": 2236.73,
  "end": 2238.93
 },
 {
  "en": "One more day.",
  "start": 2240.54,
  "end": 2242.37
 },
 {
  "en": "That's all I'm asking.",
  "start": 2243.68,
  "end": 2245.67
 },
 {
  "en": "You can go get cleaned up.",
  "start": 2247.58,
  "end": 2249.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Keep this dry.",
  "start": 2249.79,
  "end": 2251.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara...",
  "start": 2264.8,
  "end": 2266.49
 },
 {
  "en": "... I'm glad you came.",
  "start": 2269.34,
  "end": 2271.43
 },
 {
  "en": "So...",
  "start": 2280.28,
  "end": 2281.84
 },
 {
  "en": "... this is him.",
  "start": 2283.84,
  "end": 2285.33
 },
 {
  "en": "Lincoln Junior.",
  "start": 2285.44,
  "end": 2287.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Named him after yourself.",
  "start": 2287.93,
  "end": 2291.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I wasn't gonna name him Aldo.",
  "start": 2287.93,
  "end": 2291.16
 },
 {
  "en": "L. J. ..",
  "start": 2294.75,
  "end": 2296.44
 },
 {
  "en": "... this is your grandfather...",
  "start": 2296.54,
  "end": 2298.01
 },
 {
  "en": "... Aldo Burrows.",
  "start": 2299.07,
  "end": 2300.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Hi.",
  "start": 2301.47,
  "end": 2302.96
 },
 {
  "en": "I've waited for this for a long time.",
  "start": 2305.47,
  "end": 2308.2
 },
 {
  "en": "I've arranged a safe place for both of you to go to.",
  "start": 2314.68,
  "end": 2317.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, thanks for bailing us out...",
  "start": 2320.19,
  "end": 2322.92
 },
 {
  "en": "... but we gotta meet Michael.",
  "start": 2322.97,
  "end": 2324.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is he?",
  "start": 2324.73,
  "end": 2326.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Down by the border. A place called Bolshoi Booze.",
  "start": 2326.33,
  "end": 2329.96
 },
 {
  "en": "I can go alone and get him.",
  "start": 2329.98,
  "end": 2331.97
 },
 {
  "en": "No.",
  "start": 2329.98,
  "end": 2331.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Things are different.",
  "start": 2335.55,
  "end": 2337.38
 },
 {
  "en": "There's some evidence.",
  "start": 2337.47,
  "end": 2339.06
 },
 {
  "en": "We just need a little more time...",
  "start": 2339.16,
  "end": 2340.82
 },
 {
  "en": "... and we can blow this whole thing wide open.",
  "start": 2340.93,
  "end": 2343.32
 },
 {
  "en": "There is no time. I trust Michael. He has a plan to get us to Panama.",
  "start": 2343.39,
  "end": 2346.85
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't understand, Lincoln.",
  "start": 2346.88,
  "end": 2348.71
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't need to go to Panama.",
  "start": 2348.8,
  "end": 2350.99
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't need to run anymore.",
  "start": 2351.16,
  "end": 2353.63
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is he?",
  "start": 2356.51,
  "end": 2358.1
 },
 {
  "en": "I can go alone to get him.",
  "start": 2359.58,
  "end": 2361.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell me good news.",
  "start": 2361.57,
  "end": 2364.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey.",
  "start": 2361.57,
  "end": 2364.59
 },
 {
  "en": "I got Burrows. The trifecta.",
  "start": 2364.64,
  "end": 2367.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Take care of them.",
  "start": 2368.25,
  "end": 2370.05
 },
 {
  "en": "What about Scofield?",
  "start": 2368.25,
  "end": 2370.05
 },
 {
  "en": "They're gonna meet him.",
  "start": 2370.14,
  "end": 2372.3
 },
 {
  "en": "It doesn't matter.",
  "start": 2370.14,
  "end": 2372.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Do it now.",
  "start": 2372.73,
  "end": 2374.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara?",
  "start": 2410.81,
  "end": 2412.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Hi, Sara.",
  "start": 2487.49,
  "end": 2489.18
 }
]